# A Float where an Int is wanted (D164).
== SOURCE
x := 2.5; x t_ake 1 2 3
== ERROR
error[type-mismatch]: expected Int, found Float
 --> -e:1:11
  |
1 | x := 2.5; x t_ake 1 2 3
  |           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  |      --- `x` gets its type here
  |           - `x` is a Float
  = note: `t_ake` has type Int -> a -> a
  = help: Int and Float do not mix: `f_loat n` makes a Float of an Int, `f_loor x` or `c_eiling x` an Int of a Float
